{"id":"8e999d59227f4a28","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-measure.md","title":"内建σ代数与测度","display":"df-measure — 内建σ代数与测度","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-measure","aliases":["43-df-measure"],"display":"df-measure — 内建σ代数与测度","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§4.2, print pp.3–5 / PDF pp.23–25","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-measure — 内建σ代数与测度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§4.2, print pp.3–5 / PDF pp.23–25"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 是集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\Omega)\">\\(\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\Omega)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu:\\mathcal F\\to[0,+\\infty]\">\\(\\mu:\\mathcal F\\to[0,+\\infty]\\)</span>。测度谓词对所有此类候选定义。其余定义以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Measure}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\">\\(\\operatorname{Measure}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\)</span> 为前提；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\Omega\\to[-\\infty,+\\infty]\">\\(h:\\Omega\\to[-\\infty,+\\infty]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\Omega\\to[0,+\\infty]\">\\(f:\\Omega\\to[0,+\\infty]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\Omega\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(g:\\Omega\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\in\\mathcal F\">\\(E\\in\\mathcal F\\)</span>。有限序列的索引从0开始；非负扩展实数运算约定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\cdot(+\\infty)=(+\\infty)\\cdot0=0\">\\(0\\cdot(+\\infty)=(+\\infty)\\cdot0=0\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^1(\\mu)\">\\(L^1(\\mu)\\)</span> 在本目录表示实际可积函数集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L^1(\\mu)\">\\(\\mathcal L^1(\\mu)\\)</span>。涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的积分式均以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NonnegativeMeasurable}_{\\Omega,\\mathcal F}(f)\">\\(\\operatorname{NonnegativeMeasurable}_{\\Omega,\\mathcal F}(f)\\)</span> 为前提；指标函数的自变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\Omega\">\\(x\\in\\Omega\\)</span>。积分的省略域记号始终使用当前固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu\\)</span>；正负部的差只在绝对可积时定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,\\Omega)\\iff\\Omega\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathcal F\\;(\\Omega\\setminus E\\in\\mathcal F)\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathcal F^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\bigcup_nE_n\\in\\mathcal F.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,\\Omega)\\iff\\Omega\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathcal F\\;(\\Omega\\setminus E\\in\\mathcal F)\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathcal F^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\bigcup_nE_n\\in\\mathcal F.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Measure}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\iff\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,\\Omega)\\land(\\varnothing,0)\\in\\mu\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathcal F^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\Bigl((\\forall i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\;(i\\ne j\\Rightarrow E_i\\cap E_j=\\varnothing))\\Rightarrow(\\bigcup_nE_n,\\sum_n\\mu(E_n))\\in\\mu\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Measure}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\iff\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,\\Omega)\\land(\\varnothing,0)\\in\\mu\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathcal F^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\Bigl((\\forall i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\;(i\\ne j\\Rightarrow E_i\\cap E_j=\\varnothing))\\Rightarrow(\\bigcup_nE_n,\\sum_n\\mu(E_n))\\in\\mu\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\iff\\operatorname{Measure}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land(\\Omega,1)\\in\\mu.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\iff\\operatorname{Measure}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land(\\Omega,1)\\in\\mu.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NonnegativeMeasurable}_{\\Omega,\\mathcal F}(f)\\iff\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\{x\\in\\Omega:f(x)&gt;q\\}\\in\\mathcal F.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NonnegativeMeasurable}_{\\Omega,\\mathcal F}(f)\\iff\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\{x\\in\\Omega:f(x)&gt;q\\}\\in\\mathcal F.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Measurable}_{\\Omega,\\mathcal F}(h)\\iff\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\{x\\in\\Omega:h(x)&gt;q\\}\\in\\mathcal F.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Measurable}_{\\Omega,\\mathcal F}(h)\\iff\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\{x\\in\\Omega:h(x)&gt;q\\}\\in\\mathcal F.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Part}_{\\mathcal F}(E)\\iff E\\in\\mathcal F^k\\land\\bigcup_{i&lt;k}E_i=\\Omega\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;k\\;E_i\\cap E_j=\\varnothing\\qquad(k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0},\\ E\\in\\mathcal P(\\Omega)^k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Part}_{\\mathcal F}(E)\\iff E\\in\\mathcal F^k\\land\\bigcup_{i&lt;k}E_i=\\Omega\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;k\\;E_i\\cap E_j=\\varnothing\\qquad(k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0},\\ E\\in\\mathcal P(\\Omega)^k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SimpleValue}_{\\mu}((a_i)_{i&lt;k},(E_i)_{i&lt;k}):=\\sum_{i&lt;k}a_i\\mu(E_i)\\qquad((a_i)_{i&lt;k}\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}^k,\\ (E_i)_{i&lt;k}\\in\\mathcal F^k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SimpleValue}_{\\mu}((a_i)_{i&lt;k},(E_i)_{i&lt;k}):=\\sum_{i&lt;k}a_i\\mu(E_i)\\qquad((a_i)_{i&lt;k}\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}^k,\\ (E_i)_{i&lt;k}\\in\\mathcal F^k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\int_\\Omega f\\,d\\mu:=\\sup\\Bigl\\{\\operatorname{SimpleValue}_{\\mu}(a,E):k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0},\\ a\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}^k,\\ E\\in\\mathcal F^k,\\ \\operatorname{Part}_{\\mathcal F}(E),\\ \\forall i&lt;k\\;\\forall x\\in E_i\\;a_i\\le f(x)\\Bigr\\}\\quad(\\operatorname{NonnegativeMeasurable}_{\\Omega,\\mathcal F}(f)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\int_\\Omega f\\,d\\mu:=\\sup\\Bigl\\{\\operatorname{SimpleValue}_{\\mu}(a,E):k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0},\\ a\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}^k,\\ E\\in\\mathcal F^k,\\ \\operatorname{Part}_{\\mathcal F}(E),\\ \\forall i&lt;k\\;\\forall x\\in E_i\\;a_i\\le f(x)\\Bigr\\}\\quad(\\operatorname{NonnegativeMeasurable}_{\\Omega,\\mathcal F}(f)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"g^+(x):=\\max\\{g(x),0\\},\\qquad g^-(x):=\\max\\{-g(x),0\\},\\qquad |g|(x):=|g(x)|\\quad(x\\in\\Omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[g^+(x):=\\max\\{g(x),0\\},\\qquad g^-(x):=\\max\\{-g(x),0\\},\\qquad |g|(x):=|g(x)|\\quad(x\\in\\Omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L^1(\\mu):=\\{g\\in\\{h\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega:\\operatorname{Measurable}_{\\Omega,\\mathcal F}(h)\\}:\\int_\\Omega|g|\\,d\\mu&lt;\\infty\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal L^1(\\mu):=\\{g\\in\\{h\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega:\\operatorname{Measurable}_{\\Omega,\\mathcal F}(h)\\}:\\int_\\Omega|g|\\,d\\mu&lt;\\infty\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L^1(\\mu):=\\mathcal L^1(\\mu).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L^1(\\mu):=\\mathcal L^1(\\mu).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\int_\\Omega g\\,d\\mu:=\\int_\\Omega g^+\\,d\\mu-\\int_\\Omega g^-\\,d\\mu,\\qquad\\|g\\|_1:=\\int_\\Omega|g|\\,d\\mu\\quad(g\\in\\mathcal L^1(\\mu)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\int_\\Omega g\\,d\\mu:=\\int_\\Omega g^+\\,d\\mu-\\int_\\Omega g^-\\,d\\mu,\\qquad\\|g\\|_1:=\\int_\\Omega|g|\\,d\\mu\\quad(g\\in\\mathcal L^1(\\mu)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_E(x):=\\begin{cases}1,&amp;x\\in E,\\\\0,&amp;x\\in\\Omega\\setminus E,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\int_E f\\,d\\mu:=\\int_\\Omega\\mathbf1_E f\\,d\\mu,\\qquad\\int_E g\\,d\\mu:=\\int_\\Omega\\mathbf1_E g\\,d\\mu\\quad(g\\in\\mathcal L^1(\\mu)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf1_E(x):=\\begin{cases}1,&amp;x\\in E,\\\\0,&amp;x\\in\\Omega\\setminus E,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\int_E f\\,d\\mu:=\\int_\\Omega\\mathbf1_E f\\,d\\mu,\\qquad\\int_E g\\,d\\mu:=\\int_\\Omega\\mathbf1_E g\\,d\\mu\\quad(g\\in\\mathcal L^1(\\mu)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\int f\\,d\\mu:=\\int_\\Omega f\\,d\\mu,\\qquad\\int g\\,d\\mu:=\\int_\\Omega g\\,d\\mu\\quad(g\\in\\mathcal L^1(\\mu)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\int f\\,d\\mu:=\\int_\\Omega f\\,d\\mu,\\qquad\\int g\\,d\\mu:=\\int_\\Omega g\\,d\\mu\\quad(g\\in\\mathcal L^1(\\mu)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>积分由有理非负简单函数下逼近的上确界确定，允许非负积分为正无穷。可测实函数的正负部均非负可测；绝对可积时两个积分有限，差不存在∞−∞问题。这里的𝓛¹保留实际函数；若需通常L¹商空间，应另明确几乎处处相等的商关系。本目录现有概率与分析条目只使用实际函数及其积分。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：§4.2, print pp.3–5 / PDF pp.23–25。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu:\\mathcal F\\to[0,+\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Measure}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"h:\\Omega\\to[-\\infty,+\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\Omega\\to[0,+\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\Omega\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"E\\in\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"0\\cdot(+\\infty)=(+\\infty)\\cdot0=0","display":false},{"tex":"L^1(\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L^1(\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NonnegativeMeasurable}_{\\Omega,\\mathcal F}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,\\Omega)\\iff\\Omega\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathcal F\\;(\\Omega\\setminus E\\in\\mathcal F)\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathcal F^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\bigcup_nE_n\\in\\mathcal F.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Measure}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\iff\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,\\Omega)\\land(\\varnothing,0)\\in\\mu\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathcal F^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\Bigl((\\forall i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\;(i\\ne j\\Rightarrow E_i\\cap E_j=\\varnothing))\\Rightarrow(\\bigcup_nE_n,\\sum_n\\mu(E_n))\\in\\mu\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\iff\\operatorname{Measure}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land(\\Omega,1)\\in\\mu.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NonnegativeMeasurable}_{\\Omega,\\mathcal F}(f)\\iff\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\{x\\in\\Omega:f(x)>q\\}\\in\\mathcal F.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Measurable}_{\\Omega,\\mathcal F}(h)\\iff\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\{x\\in\\Omega:h(x)>q\\}\\in\\mathcal F.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Part}_{\\mathcal F}(E)\\iff E\\in\\mathcal F^k\\land\\bigcup_{i<k}E_i=\\Omega\\land\\forall i<j<k\\;E_i\\cap E_j=\\varnothing\\qquad(k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0},\\ E\\in\\mathcal P(\\Omega)^k).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SimpleValue}_{\\mu}((a_i)_{i<k},(E_i)_{i<k}):=\\sum_{i<k}a_i\\mu(E_i)\\qquad((a_i)_{i<k}\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}^k,\\ (E_i)_{i<k}\\in\\mathcal F^k).","display":true},{"tex":"\\int_\\Omega f\\,d\\mu:=\\sup\\Bigl\\{\\operatorname{SimpleValue}_{\\mu}(a,E):k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0},\\ a\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}^k,\\ E\\in\\mathcal F^k,\\ \\operatorname{Part}_{\\mathcal F}(E),\\ \\forall i<k\\;\\forall x\\in E_i\\;a_i\\le f(x)\\Bigr\\}\\quad(\\operatorname{NonnegativeMeasurable}_{\\Omega,\\mathcal F}(f)).","display":true},{"tex":"g^+(x):=\\max\\{g(x),0\\},\\qquad g^-(x):=\\max\\{-g(x),0\\},\\qquad |g|(x):=|g(x)|\\quad(x\\in\\Omega).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal L^1(\\mu):=\\{g\\in\\{h\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega:\\operatorname{Measurable}_{\\Omega,\\mathcal F}(h)\\}:\\int_\\Omega|g|\\,d\\mu<\\infty\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"L^1(\\mu):=\\mathcal L^1(\\mu).","display":true},{"tex":"\\int_\\Omega g\\,d\\mu:=\\int_\\Omega g^+\\,d\\mu-\\int_\\Omega g^-\\,d\\mu,\\qquad\\|g\\|_1:=\\int_\\Omega|g|\\,d\\mu\\quad(g\\in\\mathcal L^1(\\mu)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_E(x):=\\begin{cases}1,&x\\in E,\\\\0,&x\\in\\Omega\\setminus E,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\int_E f\\,d\\mu:=\\int_\\Omega\\mathbf1_E f\\,d\\mu,\\qquad\\int_E g\\,d\\mu:=\\int_\\Omega\\mathbf1_E g\\,d\\mu\\quad(g\\in\\mathcal L^1(\\mu)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\int f\\,d\\mu:=\\int_\\Omega f\\,d\\mu,\\qquad\\int g\\,d\\mu:=\\int_\\Omega g\\,d\\mu\\quad(g\\in\\mathcal L^1(\\mu)).","display":true}],"bytes":4022,"backlinks":[{"id":"8abc268dbc50df5d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"57783b109db5093f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baa590d3c0c1f233","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"324aa8987ee8eac3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b5fa7491a43dc01c","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 与公平硬币 Borel 概率测度 $\\mu$ 见 [[43-df-cylinder]]。$t:2^\\omega\\to[0,+\\infty]$。$\\mathrm{CE}$ 见 [[43-df-ce]]；$\\#_{\\mathbb Q}$、$\\#_2$ 与配对见 [[43-df-effective-coding]]。$\\operatorname{NonnegativeMeasurable}_{2^\\omega,\\mathcal B}$ 与非负 Lebesgue 积分 $\\int_{2^\\omega}\\!\\cdot\\,d\\mu$ 采用 [[43-df-measure]] 的正式定义。"},{"id":"1e7f22030c79f92b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1b1a52dd1295c33c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6b32588f9bb461b3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 见 [[43-df-cylinder]]。$\\nu:\\mathcal B\\to[0,1]$ 满足 [[43-df-measure]] 的 $\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(2^\\omega,\\mathcal B,\\nu)$，$X\\in2^\\omega$。下式定义 $\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)\\subseteq2^\\omega$ 及概率测度上的布尔谓词。"},{"id":"2467644590e93018","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"32a84b7035b1fc0b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bba47d15e357cf58","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4f44d765a27163f8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-measure]] — 内建σ代数与测度"},{"id":"f25448b015526e19","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d2ee5ae1d74b5b33","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $T:2^\\omega\\to2^\\omega$ 满足 $\\operatorname{ComputableCantorMap}(T)$（see [[43-df-computable-cantor-map]]），$f:2^\\omega\\to\\mathbb R$ 满足 $\\operatorname{ComputableContinuous}(f)$（see [[43-df-computable-continuous]]）。$\\mu$、$\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 采用 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的公平硬币Borel概率空间。假设 $\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\mu(T^{-1}[B])=\\mu(B)$ 及 $\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(\\mu(T^{-1}[B]\\triangle B)=0\\Rightarrow\\mu(B)\\in\\{0,1\\})$。可积函数集合 $\\mathcal L^1(\\mu)$ 与实值 Lebesgue 积分采用 [[43-df-measure]] 的正式定义，并明列积分定义域条件 $f\\in\\mathcal L^1(\\mu)$。设 $X\\in2^\\omega$ 满足 [[43-df-mlrandom]] 的 $\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)$。"},{"id":"856834e1c94138dc","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"其中可计算性与编码见 [[43-df-computable]]。$\\operatorname{NonnegativeMeasurable}_{2^\\omega,\\mathcal B}$ 与非负 Lebesgue 积分采用 [[43-df-measure]] 的正式定义；明列积分定义域条件及可和变差条件："},{"id":"ea0e84ad87980968","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"21c484b09c21e509","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cdaa5386fcc6122c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $P\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$，$X\\in2^\\omega$，$X_{\\ge n}\\in2^\\omega$ 是下式定义的第 $n$ 个尾序列（$n\\in\\mathbb N$）。有效闭类、随机性及测度见 [[43-df-pi01class]]、[[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-measure]]；$\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 及公平硬币测度采用 [[43-df-cylinder]]。"},{"id":"05e098cce7fb11ad","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"32253bde8f000c05","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8dd47210061e2447","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6a9e16f7c7ed4975","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4489a5a1ba1e9ec7","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b66d459df317acb8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$U\\in\\mathbb N$ 满足 $\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)$，$\\Omega_U$ 采用 [[43-df-omega-operator]]。固定 $\\mathcal L\\subseteq\\mathcal P([0,1])$ 与 $\\lambda:\\mathcal L\\to[0,1]$，满足 [[43-df-measure]] 的 $\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}([0,1],\\mathcal L,\\lambda)$，以及 $\\forall a,b\\in[0,1]\\;(a\\le b\\Rightarrow([a,b],b-a)\\in\\lambda)$、$\\forall N\\in\\mathcal L\\;(\\lambda(N)=0\\Rightarrow\\mathcal P(N)\\subseteq\\m